ISPOA: ISP Operation Analyzer

This is a userspace tool that analyzes the ftrace events log generated by ISP
sybsystem. The tool is written in Rust.

HOW TO USE
1. obtain the ftrace log from the target by trace-cmd.
2. build the tool by `cargo build`
3. analyze the log by `cargo run trace.txt` where trace.txt (default if omitted)
   is the event log file generated by trace-cmd.
4. if you run with `cargo run trace.txt -i`, it will additionally enters an
   interactive session. Type `h` for help.

DESIGN & IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
see https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BeD3BFq-krmKJDuqkNKj5ppyVRtR--Wg5z_y2AK2Pg0
